{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "內", "id": "內"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "炙", "id": "炙"}, {"form": "熟", "id": "熟"}, {"form": "白", "id": "白"}, {"form": "禮", "variants": [], "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "耆", "id": "耆"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "飲食", "id": "飲食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.48489224173948625, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.24850346367525575, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.9957178655054768, "source": "心", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.4011829736136412, "source": "心", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.4011829736136412, "source": "心", "target": "悅"}, {"weight": 1.6756198193154015, "source": "悅", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.912008597379632, "source": "從", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.6243265249278511, "source": "從", "target": "白"}, {"weight": 2.605155777939577, "source": "信", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.368766999875347, "source": "信", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.4228342211456226, "source": "飲食", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.5065434892714675, "source": "禮", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.4228342211456226, "source": "禮", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 3.521446509813732, "source": "禮", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.9633018917671825, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.605155777939577, "source": "禮", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 1.6888650460